          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitayafukuza mataifa mengine mbele yenu na kuipanua mipaka yenu. Hakuna mtu yeyote atakayeitamani nchi yenu wakati mnapokusanyika kuniabudu mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu mara tatu kila mwaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
